  "about": {
    "title": "About the Stormfront set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Stormfront is a Diamond & Pearl expansion released on 1 November 2008. It has 106 cards: 100 in the main set and 3 secret rares and 3 Shining Pokémon cards. There are also 98 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 100 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (198 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 204 cards, adding the 3 secret rares and 3 Shining Pokémon cards).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
  },
